title: Certify the CLI and SDK on PM 2026.9.7
description: "Upgrade the development CLI and SDK to published 2026.9.7 and pm-changelog to published 2026.9.6. Re-run real package quality and acceptance gates against the exact installed dependencies, preserving the manifest compatibility floor unless runtime behavior requires a higher minimum. Companion tracking: pm-cli-companion item pm-cli-website-6yiv."
