acceptance_criteria: Exact installed dependency versions are verified; package checks and real CLI acceptance pass without weakened gates; independent coverage and privacy limitations remain explicit
comments[2]:
  - created_at: "2026-09-07T21:14:01.876Z"
    author: codex-pm-ecosystem
    text: "2026-09-07 UTC: wall-clock sampling falsely reported 13.98x growth under concurrent fleet load. CPU sampling keeps the existing 8x bound for quadrupled input, calibrates after warm-up, and removes time spent descheduled. The full 203-test gate passes. A deliberate temporary restoration of the original quadratic HEADER_RE failed the CPU-growth assertion as required, and the exact original source bytes were restored afterward."
  - created_at: "2026-09-07T21:14:02.965Z"
    author: codex-pm-ecosystem
    text: "2026-09-07 UTC correction: the full release:check passed using installed CLI/SDK 2026.9.7 and pm-changelog 2026.9.6. The coverage-suite report is 203 tests / 203 passed / 0 failed / 0 skipped. A separate later nested acceptance reports one test and is not the package suite total. Reported line/branch/function coverage: ℹ all files |  69.31 |    87.09 |   76.07 | . Complete four-dimensional all-source coverage and independent production/privacy/review gates remain open."
    edited_at: "2026-09-07T21:33:47.310Z"
